# Bot1 casts Bloodbraid Challenger off a Forest and four Moxen on turn three. Cascade (CR 702.85a) exiles Tear
# Asunder from the top of the library and Bot1 casts it without paying its mana cost as the trigger resolves.
#
# Tear Asunder's kicker changes what it may target ("exile target artifact or enchantment", or any nonland permanent
# if kicked), so its target is chosen after the kicker is announced (CR 601.2b-c) — by the cast itself, not ahead of
# it. A cast made during a resolution used to aim every one-target spell first and then had that target refused.
# The same rule as Etali's We Say Thee Nay!, reached through another card and another effect that casts.
#
# Nothing is left to pay a kicker with, so it is cast unkicked, at the Mox Jet Bot2 played on turn two.

